# pCon.planner fix 2 of 2 — Wine dlls/rtscom
# TARGETS: crash on closing any form/dialog: "EGestureException: Unable to remove
#   IStylusSyncPlugin: Not implemented" (Vcl.Touch.Gestures.TPlatformGestureEngine.
#   TRealTimeStylus.Uninitialize on TCustomForm.Destroy). Wine's IRealTimeStylus is
#   all E_NOTIMPL stubs; VCL adds a sync plugin on form-create and removes it on
#   destroy. Implements the sync-plugin list + enable/HWND/rect accessors. Independent.
# UPSTREAMABLE: yes (WineHQ dlls/rtscom).
#
--- a/dlls/rtscom/rtscom_main.c	2026-07-09 16:36:41.347212348 +0200
